      "img": "systems/modern20/assets/icons/lorc/vomiting.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>Any creature that takes damage from a rotlord\u2019s bite must succeed on a @Check[save:fort|dc:15]{Fortitude save (DC 15)} or contract a horrible but treatable wasting disease (incubation period 1 day; 1d4 temporary Constitution). A successful @Check[skill:treatInjury|dc:24]{Treat Injury check (DC 24)} or a remove disease spell cures the affliction.</p>",
